This setting of the 105CA is suitable for operation
anywhere in the 10 meter band.  It has a 2:1 VSWR
band-width of 1700 KHz centered on 28.800 MHz.
Maximum gain is 8.20 dBd and maximum F/B is 24 dB.

Beta rod length= 28.375 inches (measured from inside
tubing edge to outside edge of clamp).  Pigtail
length= 7 inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-4000 (current
type).

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in September
1991.  9-18-91  RC


